.SH NAME
.PP
gemini-markets-spot-order-cancel-all - Cancel all open spot orders


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBgemini-markets spot order cancel-all [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Cancel all open spot orders atomically.

.PP
Note: the preview may not reflect orders placed by other sessions between
preview and execution. The cancel itself is atomic on the exchange.

.PP
Examples:
  gemini-markets spot order cancel-all
  gemini-markets spot order cancel-all --yes
  gemini-markets spot order cancel-all --dry-run -q
  gemini-markets spot order cancel-all -q


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB--account\fP=""
	account name (optional)

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	list orders that would be canceled without canceling

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for cancel-all

.PP
\fB-y\fP, \fB--yes\fP[=false]
	skip confirmation prompt


